## Chat translation options
ui-options-chat-translate = Chat Translation
ui-options-chat-translate-auto = Auto (Match Game Language)
ui-options-chat-translate-es = Spanish (Translate English to Spanish)
ui-options-chat-translate-en = English (Translate Spanish to English)
ui-options-chat-translate-bilingual = Bilingual (Original + Translation)
ui-options-chat-translate-off = Disabled (Original Only)
